<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED RETAIL 9-MTH NET UP 5.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>VASTNED RETAIL 9-MTH NET UP 5.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Direct investment result (net profit)  46.2  vs  43.7</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		  5.97 vs   5.85</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders)	   98.91 vs  N.A.</p>
<p>NOTE - Property Fund VastNed Retail NV repeated its previous</p>
<p>forecast that the direct investment result was expected to show</p>
<p>a rise in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
